WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.088
Allah chose Yunus and sent him to his people, to call them to worship only the One Allah.

2
00:00:05.488 --> 00:00:10.936
Again and again Yunus warned them, but the people turned away. No one would listen.

3
00:00:11.336 --> 00:00:17.816
Yunus was heartbroken. Without waiting for Allah's command, he boarded a great ship and sailed away.

4
00:00:18.216 --> 00:00:24.888
A terrible storm rose at sea. After casting lots, the people gently lowered Yunus into the water.

5
00:00:25.288 --> 00:00:31.816
A great fish swam up and swallowed Yunus. In the darkness, he prayed to Allah, admitting his mistake.

6
00:00:32.216 --> 00:00:38.216
In the morning, the fish cast Yunus onto the shore. Allah made a gourd vine grow to shade him.

7
00:00:38.616 --> 00:00:45.816
When Yunus returned, his people had all believed. When you do wrong, admit it right away. Allah is the Most Forgiving.
